1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:02,090
(Sheldon:)...and effect preceding cause.

2
00:00:02,260 --> 00:00:06,260
(Sheldon:)So you are thinking of a universe.
It's not expanding from the center, no.

3
00:00:06,431 --> 00:00:10,521
(Sheldon:)It is retreating
from a possibility space. Bam!

4
00:00:12,895 --> 00:00:18,355
(Sheldon:)This is a space where we are all essentially
Alice standing in front of the Red Queen...

5
00:00:18,526 --> 00:00:21,866
(Sheldon:)...and we're being offered a cracker
to quench our thirst.

6
00:00:22,447 --> 00:00:24,027
(Sheldon:)Bam!

7
00:00:24,782 --> 00:00:27,282
(Sheldon:)In another universe,
let's call that Universe Prime...

8
00:00:27,452 --> 00:00:30,202
(Sheldon:)- ...there's another Sheldon...
- We should have let him go to bed.

9
00:00:30,371 --> 00:00:31,831
(Leonard:)Bam.

10
00:00:35,168 --> 00:00:37,588
(Leonard:)I can't believe we actually did it.

11
00:00:38,379 --> 00:00:42,969
One thousand frigging Penny Blossoms.

12
00:00:43,134 --> 00:00:46,224
(Penny:)I just want you guys to know
I am really grateful for your help...

13
00:00:46,387 --> 00:00:49,807
(Penny:)...and for every dollar I make,
I'm gonna give you 20 cents.

14
00:00:50,725 --> 00:00:52,555
(Howard:)That's your entire profit margin.

15
00:00:52,977 --> 00:00:55,727
(Penny:)Oh. Then never mind.

16
00:00:56,814 --> 00:01:02,024
(Leonard:)I'll print out the shipping label.

